# Production build-time env, loaded by Vite for every 'vite build' — locally
# AND in Workers Builds, which is why it is committed: dashboard build vars
# cannot be set from the CLI, and this value is public by design (it is baked
# into the served JS bundle). It is the deterrence gate for KinEMOS R2 writes,
# mirrored by the KINEMOS_WRITE_TOKEN secret on the worker — see worker/index.ts.
# Supabase vars stay Workers Builds dashboard variables, as before.
VITE_KINEMOS_TOKEN=897f1e2dd2e07f7487f0bd339e0435ae3e28818f24029d785dc5b54b4ad517b0
